[{"location":"#Cached","page":"Home","title":"Cached","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Documentation for Cached.","category":"page"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"","category":"page"},{"location":"#Cached.DictCache","page":"Home","title":"Cached.DictCache","text":"DictCache()\n\nA cache that stores items in memory only.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#Cached.FileCache-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.FileCache","text":"FileCache(dir::AbstractString; clear = false, gitignore = true)\n\nCreates a cache at dir. If clear is true the directory is removed before creating. If gitignore is true a .gitignore file is created in the directory and all its contents will be ignored by git.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.SQLiteCache-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.SQLiteCache","text":"SQLiteCache(path::AbstractString; clear = false)\n\nCreates a SQLite based cache at path. If clear is true the file is removed before creating.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.cmap-Tuple{Any, Cached.AbstractCache, Any}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.cmap","text":"cmap(f, cache::AbstractCache, c; showprogress = true, kwargs...)\n\nMap a function over a collection, caching the results in cache.\n\nExample:\n\nusing Cached\n\ncache = SQLiteCache(\"test.sqlite\")\ncmap(x->x^2, cache, 1:10)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.drop_unused!-Tuple{SQLiteCache}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.drop_unused!","text":"Cached.drop_unused!(cache::SQLiteCache)\n\nDrop all items from the SQLite database that are not in memory.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.loadall!-Tuple{SQLiteCache}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.loadall!","text":"Cached.loadall!(cache::SQLiteCache)\n\nLoad all items from the SQLite database into memory.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.pcmap-Tuple{Any, Distributed.AbstractWorkerPool, Cached.AbstractCache, Any}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.pcmap","text":"pcmap(f, [p::AbstractWorkerPool], cache::AbstractCache, c...;\n    distributed=true, batch_size=1, \n    on_error=nothing, retry_delays=[], retry_check=nothing, \n    showprogress = true)\n\nMap a function over a collection, caching the results in cache, using p workers.\n\nExample:\n\nusing Cached\nusing Distributed\n\ncache = SQLiteCache(\"test.sqlite\")\npcmap(x->x^2, cache, 1:10)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#Cached.wrap_cache-Tuple{Any, Cached.AbstractCache}","page":"Home","title":"Cached.wrap_cache","text":"wrap_cache(f, cache::AbstractCache)\n\nWrap a function f so that its results are cached in cache.\n\nExample:\n\nusing Cached\n\ncache = SQLiteCache(\"test.sqlite\")\nf(x) = x^2\nf = wrap_cache(f, cache)\n\nf(4)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"}]
